<title>FINLAND: MINISTRY - 20 PCT OF FINNISH FIRMS SEE STAFF RISING.</title>
<headline>MINISTRY - 20 PCT OF FINNISH FIRMS SEE STAFF RISING.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>One fifth of Finnish companies expect their workforce to increase this year, the labour ministry said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It referred to a survey of some 6,000 companies.</p>
</text>
